      },
      {
        "claim_id": "clm_e1f80cb6e440",
        "text": "NVIDIA CORP has demonstrated strong revenue growth, with a compound annual growth rate of 31.95% from FY2019 to FY2022 and a year-over-year growth rate of 61.4% from FY2021 to FY2022, as indicated by metrics revenue_cagr_3y and revenue_growth_yoy.",
