        ],
        "verification_status": "supported",
        "section": "financial_health"
      },
      {
        "claim_id": "clm_fda8cb16e5c5",
        "text": "The company's gross margin has been steadily increasing, with a year-over-year change of 258.4 basis points from FY2021 to FY2022, and operating and net margins have also shown significant year-over-year improvements of 1012.9 and 1025.5 basis points, respectively, as shown by metrics gross_margin_trend_bps, operating_margin_trend_bps, and net_margin_trend_bps.",
